  "ingredients": [
    "3 pounds chicken, cut into pieces",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon paprika",
    "0.25 teaspoon sage",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.5 cup butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C) and gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hwpTR209GwrmtOcsQwzJp9x0ne0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8944-easy-shake-and-bake-chicken-AR-step-1-2270fae754c048b8982599acf41138db.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8944/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, salt, paprika, sage, and pepper together in a resealable plastic bag. Place chicken parts into the bag; seal and shake until well coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xKo8zCVsB00JZtXv-ZxxqFdG7uc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8944-easy-shake-and-bake-chicken-AR-step-3-292973a2801a40429c076a2306f62ffd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8944/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a 9x13-inch baking dish in the preheated oven. Arrange coated chicken pieces in the baking dish skin-side down and bake for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jW51ekOL22wwRpZYX65ALbrtnJQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8944-easy-shake-and-bake-chicken-AR-step-4-50e4685eb9a1434fa856fa5c7340ce3a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8944/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn chicken pieces over and bake until no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, about 20 minutes more. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9meRWKTpnPgrADD7MPzABUNoJxc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8944-easy-shake-and-bake-chicken-AR-final-d583639c19dc411db9f7f9b128446fed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8944/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DTo59cn5o2xIDQrhnrg1kLdYq9I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8944-easy-shake-and-bake-chicken-DDMFS-4x3-517318ff09e642c497342387a2e521fd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8944/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
